      en: ["The city of Yaroslavl was founded in the year 1010.", "The Church of Elijah the Prophet features frescoes dating to 1681.", "Yaroslavl is home to 140 state-protected architectural monuments.", "The historic center was added to the UNESCO list in 2005.", "The Church of St. John the Baptist has a total of 15 domes.", "In the 17th century, Yaroslavl was the second largest city in Russia."],
