      en: ["The planetarium was officially opened on September 19, 1954.", "Construction lasted approximately three years, from 1951 to 1954.", "The dome has a diameter of 25 meters.", "The main instrument is a Zeiss projector, model ZKP-1.", "It was the third planetarium built in the entire USSR.", "Over 35 million people have visited the facility since its opening."],
