      en: ["The theater opened on May 12, 1945, with the opera 'Ivan Susanin.'", "The total area of the building exceeds 40,000 square meters.", "The dome is only 8 cm thick (a ratio of 1/750 to its diameter).", "The auditorium seats approximately 1,770 people.", "The building underwent a two-year major restoration in 2005.", "It is larger in terms of area than the Bolshoi Theater in Moscow."],
