      en: ["Built between 1682 and 1687.", "Houses a set of 15 historical bells.", "The 'Sysoy' bell weighs 32 tons.", "Commissioned by Metropolitan Iona.", "Located near the shores of Lake Nero.", "Renowned for its specific chiming melodies."],
